  "description": "Forward-only delimited text (CSV, TSV, any ASCII separator) and workbooks (XLSX, ODS) read into typed column batches with a HyperCast Verdict for every cell — AOT/trim-friendly P/Invoke bindings into a native Rust core (libhypertabular) that owns no memory: this assembly allocates the buffers, the core fills them, once per batch.",
